---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Voice Agents for Small Businesses | Span AI Solutions"
  description="AI voice agents that answer calls 24/7, qualify leads, book appointments and follow up, so your business never misses an opportunity. Request a demo."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero page-shell" aria-labelledby="voice-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">AI Voice Agents</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title" id="voice-title">Never miss a call, a lead, or a follow-up again.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Our AI voice agents answer your calls, qualify leads, book appointments and follow up, then report back to you so no opportunity slips through.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=voice">Request a demo</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="#features">See what it does</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-label="Client testimonial">
      <blockquote class="quote">
        <p>“It is not uncommon for our team to propose an outlandish idea and have Josh bring a solution a few moments later. Skilled in his innovative use of AI and emerging tech…”</p>
        <footer>— Vincent Kanagaraj, worked with Josh</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="voice-problem">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="voice-problem">Every missed call is a missed customer.</h2>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li class="card">Calls come in while you're busy, after hours, or on weekends.</li>
        <li class="card">Leads go cold because nobody followed up in time.</li>
        <li class="card">You don't know what happened on calls your team didn't log.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="section-copy">Your AI voice agent closes that gap.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" id="features" aria-labelledby="voice-features">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="voice-features">What it does</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card"><h3>Answers every call</h3><p>Picks up day or night, so callers never hit voicemail.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Qualifies leads</h3><p>Asks the right questions to find out who's ready to buy.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Books appointments</h3><p>Schedules directly into your calendar.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Follows up</h3><p>Reaches back out so leads don't go cold.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Takes messages</h3><p>Captures caller details and what they need, so you can get back to them.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Reports back to you</h3><p>Sends summaries so you know exactly what happened on every call.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="voice-process">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="voice-process">Up and running without the headache</h2>
      <ol class="cards">
        <li class="card"><h3>Tell us how you work</h3><p>Your services, your common questions, and how you want calls handled.</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>We build your agent</h3><p>Custom-trained on your business and set up with your calendar and tools.</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>We test it with you</h3><p>You hear it, adjust it, and approve it before it takes a single real call.</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>Go live and stay informed</h3><p>Your agent handles calls, and you get reports on every conversation.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="voice-human">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="voice-human">Built to support your team, not replace it</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">Your voice agent picks up when you can't: after hours, on weekends, or when you're busy with a customer. It handles the call, captures the details, and reports back to you, so you never lose a lead. Callers are always told they're speaking with an AI assistant.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell faq" aria-labelledby="voice-faq">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="voice-faq">FAQ</h2>
      <details><summary>Does it sound natural?</summary><p>Yes. Request a demo and hear it for yourself.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if a caller needs to talk to me?</summary><p>Your agent captures their details and what they need, and flags it in your report so you can follow up.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does it cost?</summary><p>Pricing depends on your call volume and setup. Request a demo and we'll walk you through the options.</p></details>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="voice-cta">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <h2 class="section-heading" id="voice-cta">Hear it for yourself.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">Request a demo and we'll show you how an AI voice agent would handle calls for your business.</p>
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=voice">Request a demo</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
